&lt;li&gt;Triage product questions and issues, solving what you can and routing the rest to the right team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a working point of view on a customer&#39;s AI maturity, and use Mixpanel&#39;s own AI surface to help them build on their product data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with GTM, Product, and Engineering on escalations, and share what works with the broader Customer Value Architects team.&lt;/li&gt;
