&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mixpanel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mixpanel is the leading product intelligence and analytics platform, trusted by more than 29,000 companies to help understand how people use the products they build. By combining powerful analytics with AI that knows your business, Mixpanel helps teams see what’s working, diagnose what’s not, and decide what to build next. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://mixpanel.com/home/&quot;&gt;mixpanel.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mixpanel, our Sales team manages the full customer lifecycle—from acquisition to expansion—helping prospects and customers leverage data to better understand and improve their digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In APAC, we are building a high-performing, collaborative, and customer-obsessed sales organisation focused on accelerating growth across the region. We operate with a strong sense of ownership, ambition, and teamwork—partnering closely across Marketing, Customer Success, and Solutions Engineering to deliver meaningful outcomes for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mixpanel is looking for a commercially minded, hands-on, and people-first Head of Sales to lead and scale our business across India and South Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP of Sales, APAC, this leader will play a critical role in executing regional go-to-market strategy, driving revenue growth, and developing a high-performing team across SMB, Mid-Market, and Enterprise segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role, ideal for a leader who thrives in fast-paced, high-growth environments and is equally comfortable coaching teams, building pipelines, and engaging directly in deals across segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings a deep understanding of the Indian market, experience operating across multiple sales motions, and a passion for building teams and delivering customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Account Executives across SMB, Mid-Market, and Enterprise segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistent achievement of revenue targets across new business, expansion, and renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the VP of Sales, APAC to execute regional GTM strategy and identify growth opportunities in India and South Asia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a strong, predictable pipeline through outbound, inbound, and product-led motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a player-coach, supporting reps in strategic deals, deal progression, and executive conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and reinforce scalable sales processes and methodologies tailored to different segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational rigour across forecasting, pipeline management, and territory planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Marketing, Customer Success, Solutions Engineering, and Partnerships to execute cohesive GTM motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, and develop top sales talent across segments and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, inclusion, and continuous development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear visibility into performance, risks, and opportunities to regional leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Looking For Someone Who Has&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–10+ years of experience in SaaS sales, with 3–5+ years in a sales leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading teams across SMB, Mid-Market, and/or Enterprise segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience operating in India and/or broader South Asian markets, with a deep understanding of local business culture and buying cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a mix of inbound, outbound, and product-led sales motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDPICC, Challenger, Force Management) and ability to adapt them across segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to coach reps through varying deal complexities, from transactional to highly strategic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with experience using metrics to manage performance and inform decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for recruiting, developing, and retaining top talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on leadership style with a strong player-coach mentality&lt;/li&gt;
