&lt;p&gt;Mixpanel&#39;s brand lives in a lot of places at once — and nowhere does it move faster than in our regional markets. We&#39;re looking for a Production Designer based in London to be the design engine behind our EMEA events, local campaigns, and regional marketing moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a &quot;make it match the template&quot; role. You&#39;ll be an extension of our core Brand Design team (based in North America), translating our brand system into work that resonates in EMEA markets — while building the tools and systems that let your regional marketing partners move fast without waiting on design. You care about craft as much as you care about scale, and you know that good production design isn&#39;t a downgrade from &quot;real&quot; design work — it&#39;s its own discipline, done well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with EMEA Field Marketing, local campaign owners, and event teams, and stay in tight collaboration with the Brand Design team in NA to make sure regional work raises the bar rather than just filling a template.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for EMEA events and local campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design materials for regional events (booths, signage, swag, presentations, digital assets) and local/field marketing campaigns across EMEA markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt global campaigns and brand moments for regional context — language, market nuance, local partners — without losing the core idea&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with EMEA Field Marketing to understand what a market needs and turn it around with quality and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build systems that scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain templates, kits, and reusable components that let your regional marketing partners self-serve on lower-lift asset needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lightweight tools (Figma systems, AI-assisted workflows, or similar) that reduce production time without reducing quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where regional teams are duplicating effort and turn that into a system, not a one-off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion brand quality in the region&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure everything shipped in EMEA reflects Mixpanel&#39;s brand standards and visual identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag brand drift or quality gaps early, and coach local partners on how to use brand assets well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the person in-region people go to when they want the work to be &lt;em&gt;right&lt;/em&gt;, not just done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay tightly connected to Brand Design (NA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in close collaboration with the core Brand Design team to stay aligned on brand direction, priorities, and quality bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring EMEA market context and feedback back to the core team so the brand system gets better informed by real regional use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate the right things at the right time — know when a local need is a quick adaptation vs. something that needs core team input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re Looking For Someone Who Has&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in production or graphic design, in-house or agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fundamentals — typography, layout, composition — and a sharp eye for consistency and detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Figma; comfort working across Google Workspace and presentation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio showing range across event materials, campaign assets, templates, and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven and highly organized; you take initiative and see things through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible — comfortable with ambiguity and a fast-changing regional marketing calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in London, with the ability to work across NA and EMEA hours as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
