&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mixpanel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mixpanel is the leading product intelligence and analytics platform, trusted by more than 29,000 companies to help understand how people use the products they build. By combining powerful analytics with AI that knows your business, Mixpanel helps teams see what’s working, diagnose what’s not, and decide what to build next. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://mixpanel.com/home/&quot;&gt;mixpanel.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI has made it possible to build almost anything. The constraint on great software is no longer engineering capacity, it&#39;s judgment about what&#39;s actually worth building. Product Managers at Mixpanel build products for customers that help them answer that question, by digging deep into customer problems to answer it themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mixpanel’s Product Managers operate with high ownership and trust. As a team, we focus on helping every builder - not just the ones with a statistics background - get real answers out of messy product data, and make the judgment calls that separate delightful products from bloated ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re also our own best customer. The team uses Mixpanel every day to build Mixpanel: testing our own product intuitions against our own data, catching what works and what doesn&#39;t before our users ever see it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Managers build valuable products for customers by focusing our engineering and design teams on the problems that matter most. Check out a&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/c7SfDNFhD0E?is=FvGap0V1rZDXw7GW&quot;&gt; video demo &lt;/a&gt;of our product in action or&lt;a href=&quot;https://mixpanel.com/register/&quot;&gt; signup and explore&lt;/a&gt; one of our demo datasets.&lt;/p&gt;
