&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering and design to experiment with and ship new capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tell a clear story about what you&#39;ve shipped - to internal and external audiences - that leads with the customer problem, articulates why it matters, and uses customer stories to make the value tangible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize ruthlessly across a long list of possible bets, balancing customer impact, business value, and team capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track the metrics that tell you whether what you shipped actually worked, and course-correct when it didn&#39;t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align engineering, design, sales, marketing, and support around a shared roadmap and set of priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the market and competitive landscape to help inform where Mixpanel should invest next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the product function at Mixpanel: what it&#39;s responsible for, how it interfaces with other teams and how it&#39;ll develop over time&lt;/li&gt;
