&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mixpanel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mixpanel is the leading product intelligence and analytics platform, trusted by more than 29,000 companies to help understand how people use the products they build. By combining powerful analytics with AI that knows your business, Mixpanel helps teams see what’s working, diagnose what’s not, and decide what to build next. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://mixpanel.com/home/&quot;&gt;mixpanel.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the APAC Marketing Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The APAC Marketing team builds pipeline, awareness, and retention across one of Mixpanel&#39;s most strategic growth regions. We run everything from events and partner marketing to localization and customer marketing, working closely with counterparts in EMEA and the US and cross-functionally with sales, partnerships, pre-sales, and customer success across APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Regional Marketing Manager to help build the foundations of our ANZ business from the ground up. You&#39;ll own programs across the full customer lifecycle: acquisition, conversion, activation, and retention, with events as a core piece of the mix. This is a role for someone who can navigate ambiguity with confidence, since there&#39;s no existing playbook for this market yet. You&#39;ll define what works, bring in the right partners, and become the go-to expert other teams turn to for input on ANZ. Reporting to the APAC Marketing Director, you&#39;ll balance hands-on execution with the judgment to know which bets are worth making and which tradeoffs matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute ANZ marketing programs end-to-end, including events and customer marketing, from planning through measurable pipeline outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage full event logistics: venue sourcing, vendor management, on-site execution, and follow-through to pipeline conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and test new marketing channels, then decide which are worth scaling based on results, not assumptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer advocacy and engagement through community programs that deepen relationships with existing users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance metrics closely and adjust programs and processes to hit pipeline goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate risks and dependencies across ANZ initiatives and communicate them proactively to the APAC Marketing Director and cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the go-to source on ANZ market dynamics, sharing what you learn with APAC and global marketing peers so their programs land better in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
