&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Enterprise Account Executive to lead Mixpanel&#39;s largest, most complex deals across key EMEA markets. You&#39;ll own strategic enterprise accounts end-to-end — building multi-threaded relationships with senior stakeholders, running complex sales cycles, and closing new business that shapes how the region grows. You&#39;ll work closely with GTM leadership as a strategic partner, anticipating market shifts and proactively shaping the regional approach rather than just executing within it. You&#39;ll also influence peers, sharing what&#39;s working across accounts to raise the bar for the wider team. This role suits someone who navigates ambiguity with confidence, builds trust quickly at the C-level, and thinks several steps ahead of the deal in front of them.&lt;/p&gt;
