&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into high-growth Indian technology companies across sectors such as Fintech, eCommerce/Retail, Media &amp;amp; Entertainment, or SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Indian enterprise technology landscape, including key accounts, buying cycles, and local procurement practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Mixpanel or other product analytics tools (e.g., Amplitude, Heap, Pendo)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with senior technology or product leaders in the Indianmarket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in high-growth SaaS environments (Series B–E or beyond)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
